<body>
    <h1>Phase 1a (PI17-19) Deliverables</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 92.=
2341%;">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 3.11355%;">
<col style=3D"width: 47.6801%;">
<col style=3D"width: 7.02076%;">
<col style=3D"width: 8.36386%;">
<col style=3D"width: 33.7607%;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Item</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Capabilities&nbsp;</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Current Status</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Completion Date</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Comments</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Merge MPSYS Subscription Services database to MP=
SYS database</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Complete</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<div class=3D"content-wrapper">
<p>11/10/2023</p>
</div></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><br></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Buildout of IdentityGraph Services - create the =
microservices and start building out the endpoints.</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Complete</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">3/14/2024</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>We have a total of 5 mSs that clients will us=
e to access our functionality and 1 internal mS that we will use to publish=
 to and consume from Azure Event Hub topics.&nbsp; This was slightly delaye=
d by the renaming effort but is done now with the first release in 19.1.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>3</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Build CG services for LDAP retirement =E2=80=
=93 ingestion of MPSYS data into MPSYS.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In Progress</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>PI19 Date TBD</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>This is a CG effort and they are working with=
 DTI etc to deliver this in PI19.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>4</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Build CG services for LDAP retirement =E2=80=
=93 CG development of mS to vend data to clients.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Not Started</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">TBD</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>This was not prioritized by CG in PI19 becaus=
e of resource capacity limitations. Currently, the MPSYS Modernization Epic=
 priority needs to be 150 or less to meet CGs threshold.&nbsp; CG team is l=
ooking for additional resource capacity to take on this work.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">5</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">As part of National Retail OTP project: onboard =
them to IDG CIR and implement Kafka processing for courtesy notification de=
livery (funded by that project)</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Complete</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<div class=3D"content-wrapper">
<p>12/01/2023&nbsp;</p>
</div></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>This work was completed but, due to a last-mi=
nute change in direction from the business, it was not implemented in produ=
ction.&nbsp; The work has been saved and will be implemented at a later dat=
e.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
